SUMMARY:Grief Summer Studio Series: Terrarium Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Come get your hands dirty! Join us for this experiential workshop combining art and nature elements to explore grief experiences. Participants will create nature-based art to invite the healing power of nature and explore the various layers of grief. \nChildren and teens are welcome to register with a participating adult. \nGroup starts promptly at 6:00pm and end time is flexible. The studio will remain open until 8:30pm. \nRegistration is limited\, please call 919-719-7199 to reserve your space.
URL:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/event/grief-summer-studio-series-terrarium-workshop/
LOCATION:Transitions LifeCare\, 250 Hospice Circle\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Grief Support,Grief Support for Adults,Grief Support for Kids & Teens,Kids Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Terrariums-scaled-e1746806556699.jpg
GEO:35.8074456;-78.7418081
