UID:10002818-1781784000-1781789400@www.transitionslifecare.org
SUMMARY:Grieving Brain (virtual)
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we delve into the ways that grief affects our brain using the book The Grieving Brain: The Surprising Science of How We Learn from Love and Loss by Dr. Mary-Frances O’Conner as our guide to explore the processes naturally occurring in our brain that shape our response to loss. This is not a book club\, reading the book is not required. \nRegistration required. Call 919.719.7199. \n  \nTransitions GriefCare provides grief support at no charge to the bereaved. If you’d like to help us continue this service\, please consider making a donation at transitionslifecare.org/donate.
URL:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/event/grieving-brain-virtual/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:Grief Support,Grief Support for Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/iStock-838485934-scaled.jpg
GEO:35.7595731;-79.0192997
END:VEVENT
